LAB -- UC8
LAB -- UC10
LAB -- UC11
LAB -- UC12
LAB -- UC14
LAB -- UC15

DEV -- UC7

UC1 ..> UC16 : <<include>>
WP ..> UC1 : <<extend>>
UC2 ..> PREV : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC16 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> QG : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC16 : <<include>>
RB ..> UC4 : <<extend>>
UC5 ..> CB : <<include>>
UC6 ..> SR : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC16 : <<include>>
MO ..> UC6 : <<extend>>
AO ..> UC6 : <<extend>>
